# Source: Ventrax AV4 report. Acceptance specification; execution is verified separately.
Feature: Safety alerts and notifications

  Scenario: Generate an alert from a critical gas reading
    Given an active rule for a gas safety metric
    And an authorized telemetry event matches the rule condition
    When the event is processed by Alerting
    Then an alert is created with the corresponding severity
    And a notification is prepared using the account preferences

  Scenario: Avoid duplicate alerts for the same event
    Given an alert exists for a device, eventId and rule
    When the same event is processed again
    Then no additional alert or notification is created

  Scenario: Acknowledge an open alert
    Given an alert has status OPEN
    When an authorized user acknowledges the alert
    Then its status becomes ACKNOWLEDGED
